WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.310
Attention!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.150
Everyone did their best in the
Sports Day games the other day.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.030
It was such a wonderful day!

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.950
However... I remembered something.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.280
I remembered that you Year 1
students picked a fight with us.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:22.000
So, in order to further deepen
our friendship, we planned an event.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.000
It is...

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:25.790
...test of courage!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.630
Whaaaaaat?!

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:01.970
Period 8
Spine-chiller! Titan Junior High School

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:09.060
In any case, school seems like
a totally different place at night.

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:13.610
I'm scared of the dark. I'm scared of the dark.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:16.450
Armin, you scare easily.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.830
What do you see?

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:25.210
Sorry I scared you.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:30.710
I'm Erwin Smith. I'm the advisor for
the Attack Junior High Scout Regiment.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:34.090
I-I didn't know that there was an advisor.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.470
Right! Our advisor!

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:40.680
It's thanks to Mr. Smith's help
that we can use the school tonight.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.680
We just asked him to secretly
borrow the key, though.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.890
Well, enough about that!
Let's get started already!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.520
Eren, Jean, Mikasa, Conny, and Armin will start

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.440
at the stairs on the right
of the school building!

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.070
Ymir, Christa, Sasha, Reiner,
and Bertholdt will start at the left stairs!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.700
All you have to do is
visit the art room, music room,

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:02.030
and science room, in that order,

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.870
and write your names on the blackboard.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.120
The rules are so simple
that even a kid could follow them.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:07.330
<b>Gym
Goal
School Building</b>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:07.540
<b>School Building
Goal
Gym</b>

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:11.790
Year 1 students will go first and we'll
all meet at the gym at the end, okay?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.920
What?! The upperclassmen aren't going first?!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.880
Hey, don't tell me you're scared...

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.890
Don't be stupid! Unlike you, I really
wanna take a test of courage right now!

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.050
What a coincidence!

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:26.600
So do I! Although I don't like
the fact that we agree on something!

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.780
- I'm scared of the dark, I'm scared of the dark...

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:38.030
- If you aren't going, we're gonna go first.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:41.570
Christa, if you get scared,
you can just hang on to me, okay?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.660
I'm scared of the dark, I'm scared
of the dark, I'm scared of the dark...

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.500
O-Okay, then! We're gonna go as well!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:51.670
- I'm scared of the dark, I'm scared of the dark...

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.670
- Hey, shine the flashlight more in this direction!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.420
- What? Are you scared?!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.460
- Don't be stupid, you bastard!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.340
- Shut up, you horse face.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.220
I'm not horse-faced!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.380
Tsk. They're finally gone.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:04.390
Seriously? Most people stop being
scared of ghosts in elementary school.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:04.800
- Now I, on the other hand, was already
brave enough to go to the bathroom alone,

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.350
- Well then, guys,

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.140
- we're now starting Attack Junior High Scout Regiment's customary event,

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.980
- we're now starting Attack Junior High Scout Regiment's customary event,
- even in the dark of night, by the time I was in nursery school.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.860
- the 57th Test of Courage to welcome new members.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:18.820
Move forward!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.030
<b>Art Room</b>

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.750
Looks like no one's here.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.290
Okay! I'll be the first!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.210
Dammit! Stop!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.290
When were they here?!

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:35.420
<b>Sasha
Reiner
Ymir
Christa</b>

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:35.500
<b>Reiner
Ymir
Christa</b>

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.340
I'll write before you!

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:38.840
What're you doing, you bastard?!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:39.340
- Let me go!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.760
- Hey, write my name, too.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.310
D-D-Don't tell me this is...

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.350
...the Seven Wonders
of Attack Junior High, No. 1...

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.850
"Laughing Mona Lisa"!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.820
Hey, Bertholdt...

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.870
What?

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.870
Why do you think girls always
go to the bathroom together?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.210
Beats me.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.420
What's wrong, Reiner?

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.420
Never mind, it was nothing.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:37.230
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.610
Come to think of it, one of the Seven Wonders
relates to the bathroom, right?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:44.240
If you knock on the third door
from the back three times late at night,

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.700
Hanako will answer
and drag you inside the stall.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.040
D-Don't do it.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.950
It'll be fine.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.420
See? Nothing happ—

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.710
Y-e-s?

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:11.560
Don't worry, Christa! I'll protect you
no matter what I have to sacrifice!

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:13.600
- So marry me when this test of courage is—

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.100
- Well... I'm Sasha.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:20.480
My precious Christa
turned into the potato girl!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.190
Christa did Christa to Christa!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.400
<b>Music Room</b>

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.540
Th-Th-This test of cour... isn't g-g-g-oo...

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.290
The test of courage isn't good?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.620
- I-I-If... s-s-see all...

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.580
- If you see all of the Seven Wonders...

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.790
- ...y-y-you'll... m-m-misfor...

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.290
- ...you'll be cursed and misfortune will befall you.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.460
Does it mean that my never-ending
popularity will come to an end?!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.590
Could it be that the curse is
the reason I flunked all my tests?!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.600
No, that happened because you're an idiot.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.560
Wh-What's that?!

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.600
...S-S-Sev... 2...

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:59.560
The Seven Wonders of Attack Junior High, No. 2.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:03.110
Beethoven, playing Symphony No. 5 like crazy...

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:23.340
Eren!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.010
Eren! Wait!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.800
Hey, Reiner...

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:31.930
What?

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:36.220
Am I imagining things?
I feel like we just keep going up and up.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.730
You're imagining things.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:48.190
L-Looks like they got separated from me.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.530
Oh, it's just a mirror.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:55.620
But why in the hell is there
a mirror in a place like this?!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.870
It's just my imagination!
I know it's my imagination!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.250
I definitely didn't see a woman
with long hair in the mirror!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.670
I definitely didn't see he...r...

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:16.140
Eren!

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:18.430
Huh? Mikasa?!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:19.640
What happened?

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:23.900
Nothing! I slipped a little
and fell down the stairs, that's all!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.690
I definitely didn't see a woman
with long hair in a mirror, okay?!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.280
C-Could that be...
S-Seven... of Attack... No. 3...

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.740
The Seven Wonders of Attack Junior High, No. 3.

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:33.740
- C-Cur... inf......or...

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:37.790
- A cursed infinity mirror at the landing of the stairs on the second floor.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.910
- I-If... eye con......or...

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.290
- If you have eye contact with the ghost that appears in this mirror...

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.960
- ...yo... dra......or...

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.880
- ...you'll be dragged into the mirror.

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:49.760
At any rate, Mikasa, I'm impressed
that you can tell what Armin's saying.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.630
I didn't see anything!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.930
- Eren! Wait!
- I didn't see a woman with long hair!

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:59.520
I definitely didn't see a ghost!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:07.820
Reiner, something really <i>is</i> strange.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.230
You're imagining things.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:13.240
You think so? I feel like we've
been going up for a long time now.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.320
You're imagining things.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.570
No, we've being going up for about half an hour.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:17.910
You're imagining things.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.450
Christa!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:20.200
- Please wait! Please wait!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.370
- Christa!

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.460
- Like I said, Reine—

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.670
- You're imagining things.

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:30.460
Ymir! Sasha! Where are you?!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.890
Ymir!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:38.970
Whoa! Wh-What's wrong?

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.930
<b>Science Room</b>

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.650
Looks like Reiner and the others
haven't been here yet.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:53.360
This is strange. You'd think
we'd pass each other at some point.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:54.700
Coul... be...?!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:55.150
- Th-Th... to the... danc... screa...?

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.860
- Could it be that they fell victim

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.290
- to the Dancing Human Figure and the Screaming Skeleton,

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.500
No. 4 and No. 5 of the
Seven Wonders of Attack Junior High?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.380
Hey, Jean! Don't pull my shirt!
You'll stretch it!

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:12.420
You're the one who's
pulling my shirt. Cut it out.

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:28.350
Dammit! What's wrong with this school?!

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.650
I saw nothing! Nothing!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:33.530
H-Hey, how many of the
Seven Wonders have we seen?

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.780
As it stands, misfortune will befall us.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:36.950
- W-W-W...

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:39.530
- We're done for. We're cursed.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.870
...rista!

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.490
Christa!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.370
Please wait!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.500
Sasha and Ymir?

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.000
Hey, Reiner.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.500
We've been going up for a long time, haven't we?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.960
You're imagining things.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:57.630
But if I remember correctly,
our school has only three floors, right?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.300
I feel like we've gone up
several dozen floors already.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:07.690
I see. So you got separated
from your friends, huh?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.940
I'm so, so scared.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.690
Oh, don't let your nose run like that.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.150
You're cute, Christa,
so you should act like a proper lady.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:18.660
Here, blow your nose.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.030
Okay, good job.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.370
But be careful.
Even if it's the test of courage,

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.000
you shouldn't walk around
late at night like this.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:29.000
Or you'll become a delinquent like me.

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:33.210
I don't mind becoming like you.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.250
What?!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.090
Do you think I can be like you when I grow up?

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.380
Don't bother!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.600
Don't bother! You can stay as you are!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:48.730
Christa! Christa!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:49.520
- Ah! Ymir!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.270
- Christa!

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:57.110
Christa!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.950
Hey, Ymir.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:03.910
Ah, by the way, this is Ymir.
She's the one I was— Huh?

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.830
Hey!

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.040
Guys!

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.500
Huh? Where are Reiner and Bertholdt?

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:14.420
Something is wrong. Be careful.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:15.630
Right.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.720
Now, Ymir. Stop crying.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.600
But... But...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.890
Hey, let's go!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:33.730
We're finally at the goal, huh?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.690
- Th-Th... S-Sev...

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:41.490
- Th-This is the Seven Wonders of Attack Junior High, No. 6.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.450
- Th-Th... S-Sev...

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:47.120
The Headless Dribbling Ghost...

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:54.500
- I'm gonna get you...

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:07.390
I'm gonna get you...

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.680
I didn't see them! I didn't see them!
I didn't see Mona Lisa, Beethoven,

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:13.940
ghosts, moving human figures,
or spirits! I saw none of them!

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:15.310
You <i>can</i> see them!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.360
I can't hear them!
I can't hear them! I can't hear them!

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:19.860
I can't hear anything at all!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.900
You <i>can</i> hear them!

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.160
What's that?!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.220
Help! Help! Help! Help!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.560
Help me, Grandpa!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:12.290
You'd better not have wet your pants, you brats.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.210
L-Levi?!

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:15.210
Oruo!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.170
I wish you had bitten your tongue off
and died this time for sure.

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:19.500
Petra and the others?!

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.000
Our performance was very convincing, wasn't it?

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.630
Good job, guys.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.010
You, too, Hange?!

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:28.340
Well, I didn't know what was going on
at the end, but it was fun, wasn't it?

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:32.390
Were all those things possibly your doing?!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.850
Then that lady in white clothes, too?

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.810
Oh, so that's what was going on.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.570
White clothes? What're you talking about?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.400
We don't know anyone like that.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:43.900
What?!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.950
The Seven Wonders of Attack Junior High, No. 7!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.950
It's said that there's a girl who went
missing during the test of courage

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.830
but she hasn't noticed that she's become a ghost,

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:58.420
so she's still wandering around
the school looking for someone to scare.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.000
What did you see?

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:03.710
Wha—?! What're you saying?!
I didn't see anyth—

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.380
Hey, Mikasa! What'd you do that for?!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.430
Eren, a mosquito.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.800
Who cares!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:51.700
All I want is...
to be by Annie's side, and yet...

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.620
Encouraged by Reiner and the others,

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.990
Bertholdt, who has a crush on Annie,
asks her out to a summer festival.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:00.000
Sweet Summer! Titan Junior High School
